# Engaged reader counts (permanent)

Every published article **must** include in `.article-byline`:

```html
<span class="reader-count" data-reader-count data-article-slug="{slug}" data-reader-hit hidden></span>
```

- `{slug}` = filename without `.html`
- `data-reader-hit` only on article pages (never on archive/homepage cards)
- Counting is implemented in `js/main.js` via Abacus
- A reader is counted only after **more than 25 seconds** of **visible** dwell time; leaving sooner must not count
- Do not remove this markup when regenerating or replacing articles
- Do not change the 25-second threshold unless the user explicitly asks
